{"meta": {"limit": 100, "next": null, "offset": 0, "previous": null, "total_count": 49}, "objects": [{"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2023-09-28T08:25:00Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 342428, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 14, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/342428/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/2/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-09-28T07:13:37Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-05-30T15:06:03Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 348057, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/348057/", "rev": "06", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-11-27T15:06:03Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-05-30T15:11:44Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 348058, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/348058/", "rev": "07", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-11-27T15:11:44Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-04-22T04:51:31Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 343691, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 17, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/343691/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-10-20T04:51:31Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-07-26T18:43:16Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 350791, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/350791/", "rev": "08", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-01-23T18:43:16Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-07-26T18:43:16Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 360722, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/360722/", "rev": "08", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-04-30T04:19:22Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-11-02T04:17:48Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 360795, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/360795/", "rev": "09", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-05-01T04:17:48Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-07-26T18:43:16Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 351011, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/351011/", "rev": "08", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-01-25T19:55:06Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document describes a number of changes to TLS and DTLS IANA\n   registries that range from adding notes to the registry all the way\n   to changing the registration policy.  These changes were mostly\n   motivated by WG review of the TLS- and DTLS-related registries\n   undertaken as part of the TLS 1.3 development process.\n\n   This document obsoletes RFC8447 and updates the following RFCs: 3749,\n   5077, 4680, 5246, 5705, 5878, 6520, 7301.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2022-09-30T16:52:12Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 305419, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/305419/", "rev": "00", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-03-29T16:52:12Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document describes a number of changes to TLS and DTLS IANA\n   registries that range from adding notes to the registry all the way\n   to changing the registration policy.  These changes were mostly\n   motivated by WG review of the TLS- and DTLS-related registries\n   undertaken as part of the TLS 1.3 development process.\n\n   This document obsoletes RFC8447 and updates the following RFCs: 3749,\n   5077, 4680, 5246, 5705, 5878, 6520, 7301.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2022-09-30T16:52:12Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 305643, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/305643/", "rev": "00", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-04-04T01:17:55Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document describes a number of changes to TLS and DTLS IANA\n   registries that range from adding notes to the registry all the way\n   to changing the registration policy.  These changes were mostly\n   motivated by WG review of the TLS- and DTLS-related registries\n   undertaken as part of the TLS 1.3 development process.\n\n   This document obsoletes RFC 8447 and updates the following RFCs:\n   3749, 5077, 4680, 5246, 5705, 5878, 6520, and 7301.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2023-01-09T05:25:14Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 310069, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 24, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/310069/", "rev": "01", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-07-08T04:25:14Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document describes a number of changes to TLS and DTLS IANA\n   registries that range from adding notes to the registry all the way\n   to changing the registration policy.  These changes were mostly\n   motivated by WG review of the TLS- and DTLS-related registries\n   undertaken as part of the TLS 1.3 development process.\n\n   This document obsoletes RFC 8447 and updates the following RFCs:\n   3749, 5077, 4680, 5246, 5705, 5878, 6520, and 7301.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2023-04-27T16:31:52Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 317785, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 22, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/317785/", "rev": "02", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-10-24T16:31:52Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2023-08-06T05:14:32Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 324266, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 14, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/324266/", "rev": "03", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-02-02T05:14:32Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2023-09-28T08:25:00Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 328831, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 14, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/328831/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-03-27T08:25:00Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2023-09-28T08:25:00Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 329558, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 14, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/329558/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-03-29T01:04:55Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2024-11-02T04:17:48Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 373620, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/373620/", "rev": "09", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-10-16T18:57:11Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries and adds a\n   \"Comments\" column to all active registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2025-05-07T22:26:30Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 375793, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/375793/", "rev": "10", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-11-03T22:26:30Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries and adds a\n   \"Comments\" column to all active registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2025-05-07T22:26:30Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 385441, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/385441/", "rev": "10", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-03-06T00:06:43Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries and adds a\n   \"Comments\" column to all active registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2025-05-07T22:26:30Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 385533, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "durumcrustulum@gmail.com", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/385533/", "rev": "10", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/durumcrustulum@gmail.com/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-03-06T20:56:18Z", "title": "IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document updates the changes to TLS and DTLS IANA registries\n   made in RFC 8447.  It adds a new value \"D\" for discouraged to the\n   recommended column of the selected TLS registries and adds a\n   \"Comments\" column to all active registries.\n\n   This document updates the following RFCs: 3749, 5077, 4680, 5246,\n   5705, 5878, 6520, 7301, and 8447.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis/", "expires": "2025-05-07T22:26:30Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 385538, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-rfc8447bis", "note": "", "notify": "durumcrustulum@gmail.com", "pages": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/385538/", "rev": "10", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/durumcrustulum@gmail.com/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/43/"], "std_leve